[
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 10.34,
    "text": "My mother-in-law's niece's daughter, but, um, she's the one that's paying nothing."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 10.34,
    "end_time": 11.34,
    "text": "She got in for free."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 11.34,
    "end_time": 12.34,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 12.34,
    "end_time": 14.0,
    "text": "She knew she wasn't even accepted."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 14.0,
    "end_time": 15.5,
    "text": "They pushed and pushed and pushed."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 15.5,
    "end_time": 26.5,
    "text": "Her grandfather is Shragomash Akaminovich from Mir, so he called up and got her in."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 27.5,
    "end_time": 30.5,
    "text": "What's doing there?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 30.5,
    "end_time": 32.5,
    "text": "Nothing, so I had specimens for today."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 32.5,
    "end_time": 33.5,
    "text": "What is it?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 33.5,
    "end_time": 35.5,
    "text": "It was my next-door neighbor, Susan."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 35.5,
    "end_time": 36.5,
    "text": "She moved away."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 36.5,
    "end_time": 37.5,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 37.5,
    "end_time": 40.5,
    "text": "But, um, she'd taken the girls?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 40.5,
    "end_time": 41.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 41.5,
    "end_time": 44.5,
    "text": "She invited Elkinsari and chose you, but I'm just taking Elkinsari."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 44.5,
    "end_time": 45.5,
    "text": "Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 45.5,
    "end_time": 47.5,
    "text": "What'd you get as a gift?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 47.5,
    "end_time": 52.5,
    "text": "I got her a set of towels, three towels with her name on it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 52.5,
    "end_time": 53.5,
    "text": "Oh, that's nice."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 53.5,
    "end_time": 57.5,
    "text": "Yeah, because they just moved into a new house, and she's her only daughter."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 57.5,
    "end_time": 58.5,
    "text": "She has her own bedroom."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 58.5,
    "end_time": 59.5,
    "text": "She has her own bathroom."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 59.5,
    "end_time": 60.5,
    "text": "Mm-hmm."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 60.5,
    "end_time": 62.5,
    "text": "So, very nice."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 62.5,
    "end_time": 63.5,
    "text": "Very pretty."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 63.5,
    "end_time": 69.5,
    "text": "It's pink with, you know, like maroon lettering and, you know, green flower underneath."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 69.5,
    "end_time": 71.5,
    "text": "That's great."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 71.5,
    "end_time": 74.5,
    "text": "And that's my big thing today."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 74.5,
    "end_time": 76.5,
    "text": "How's school going?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 76.5,
    "end_time": 78.5,
    "text": "The baby was sick again on Friday."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 78.5,
    "end_time": 79.5,
    "text": "With what?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 79.5,
    "end_time": 81.5,
    "text": "She doesn't digest it well."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 81.5,
    "end_time": 82.5,
    "text": "So what's going to be?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 82.5,
    "end_time": 85.5,
    "text": "So I'm going to take her to a specialist and then hand Gribbets."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 85.5,
    "end_time": 87.5,
    "text": "I've heard of Gribbets."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 87.5,
    "end_time": 89.5,
    "text": "Yeah, he's a big doctor."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 89.5,
    "end_time": 90.5,
    "text": "Did he get an appointment?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 90.5,
    "end_time": 95.5,
    "text": "No, my mother-in-law's going to call us today."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 95.5,
    "end_time": 100.5,
    "text": "And, um, do they think that that's what caused it?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 100.5,
    "end_time": 103.5,
    "text": "That the whole digestive system about awake?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 103.5,
    "end_time": 104.5,
    "text": "Maybe."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 104.5,
    "end_time": 105.5,
    "text": "But she, I mean, she wasn't sick."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 105.5,
    "end_time": 111.5,
    "text": "You don't see her or anything, but she, um, you know, she was constipated again on Friday."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 111.5,
    "end_time": 114.5,
    "text": "It took me about three hours to get it out."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 114.5,
    "end_time": 117.5,
    "text": "And yesterday again, it's very harsh."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 117.5,
    "end_time": 120.5,
    "text": "I need something that, you know, will soften it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 120.5,
    "end_time": 122.5,
    "text": "Wow. Poor kid."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 122.5,
    "end_time": 124.5,
    "text": "Did you have this with somebody else?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 124.5,
    "end_time": 126.5,
    "text": "Yeah, but they, it wasn't as bad."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 126.5,
    "end_time": 129.5,
    "text": "You know, I would just take a thermometer and they would go."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 129.5,
    "end_time": 130.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 130.5,
    "end_time": 132.5,
    "text": "I remember somebody was constipated."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 132.5,
    "end_time": 135.5,
    "text": "I'm always constipated."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 135.5,
    "end_time": 137.5,
    "text": "And I spoke to mom last night."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 137.5,
    "end_time": 138.5,
    "text": "Yeah, what did she say?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 138.5,
    "end_time": 142.5,
    "text": "Well, I called her because I had sent the package and I didn't know if she got it yet,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 142.5,
    "end_time": 143.5,
    "text": "but she didn't."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 143.5,
    "end_time": 146.5,
    "text": "And I told you all those school things."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 146.5,
    "end_time": 147.5,
    "text": "Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 147.5,
    "end_time": 149.5,
    "text": "She didn't get it yet."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 149.5,
    "end_time": 152.5,
    "text": "And, um, what did she say?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 152.5,
    "end_time": 153.5,
    "text": "She started to tell me something."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 153.5,
    "end_time": 155.5,
    "text": "Oh, Bakhanan Heidi."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 155.5,
    "end_time": 156.5,
    "text": "What?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 156.5,
    "end_time": 157.5,
    "text": "That, they called her."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 157.5,
    "end_time": 159.5,
    "text": "They wanted her to come for circus."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 159.5,
    "end_time": 164.5,
    "text": "Because Heidi just said that she's going to have to go on Yantzis."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 164.5,
    "end_time": 165.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 165.5,
    "end_time": 169.5,
    "text": "She's going to have to take her who's going to, you know, be with the kids or whatever."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 169.5,
    "end_time": 178.5,
    "text": "And dad doesn't want to go because he, he feels that it's going to be too hard on mom."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 178.5,
    "end_time": 182.5,
    "text": "But mom said, she said to me, you know, I really feel I should go."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 182.5,
    "end_time": 183.5,
    "text": "You know, they're asking me."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 183.5,
    "end_time": 184.5,
    "text": "They need me."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 184.5,
    "end_time": 185.5,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 185.5,
    "end_time": 191.5,
    "text": "And her mother doesn't know until a week before if she can get off."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 191.5,
    "end_time": 198.5,
    "text": "So, so mom's going to go."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 200.5,
    "end_time": 201.5,
    "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 201.5,
    "end_time": 202.5,
    "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 202.5,
    "end_time": 203.5,
    "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 203.5,
    "end_time": 204.5,
    "text": "What about her cousin that she's always helping out?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 204.5,
    "end_time": 207.5,
    "text": "Oh, I think Heidi's a total idiot if you ask me."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 207.5,
    "end_time": 209.5,
    "text": "I mean, when we're going to your bar mitzvah, remember?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 209.5,
    "end_time": 210.5,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 210.5,
    "end_time": 213.5,
    "text": "So I said to her, why don't you just, you and Bakhanan fly?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 213.5,
    "end_time": 215.5,
    "text": "She was a little bit about the kids."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 215.5,
    "end_time": 217.5,
    "text": "I said, hi, do you took your cousin's kids?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 217.5,
    "end_time": 218.5,
    "text": "We'll find them."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 218.5,
    "end_time": 219.5,
    "text": "Why can't you leave?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 219.5,
    "end_time": 220.5,
    "text": "She wasn't there."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 220.5,
    "end_time": 223.5,
    "text": "And so, why can't you leave the other ones?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 223.5,
    "end_time": 228.5,
    "text": "She said, she's a little very hard time for her now because her husband's starting school."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 228.5,
    "end_time": 230.5,
    "text": "I said, so what?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 230.5,
    "end_time": 233.5,
    "text": "Isn't it always a hard time for everybody?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 233.5,
    "end_time": 238.5,
    "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 238.5,
    "end_time": 240.5,
    "text": "She always takes them happily."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 240.5,
    "end_time": 242.5,
    "text": "And I know her cousin."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 242.5,
    "end_time": 244.5,
    "text": "Heidi would take them."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 244.5,
    "end_time": 246.5,
    "text": "She's got something against asking it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 246.5,
    "end_time": 248.5,
    "text": "I don't know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 248.5,
    "end_time": 252.5,
    "text": "So, listen, it's her business, not mine."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 252.5,
    "end_time": 254.5,
    "text": "So mom doesn't want to go or dad doesn't want to go?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 254.5,
    "end_time": 256.5,
    "text": "Dad doesn't want to go."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 256.5,
    "end_time": 257.5,
    "text": "He never wants to go."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 257.5,
    "end_time": 258.5,
    "text": "I know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 258.5,
    "end_time": 261.5,
    "text": "It probably will be hard for mom."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 261.5,
    "end_time": 266.5,
    "text": "But then I said to mom, I said, well, I'm sure, you know, Heidi, she has everything already and set."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 266.5,
    "end_time": 270.5,
    "text": "You know, so she said, no, she hasn't been feeling so well lately."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 270.5,
    "end_time": 271.5,
    "text": "She's been feeling very happy."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 271.5,
    "end_time": 274.5,
    "text": "I don't think she really has anything prepared."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 274.5,
    "end_time": 281.5,
    "text": "I said, maybe if you, you know, mentioned her to prepare it all."
