  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 285.5,
    "end_time": 287.5,
    "text": "I'm sure she's preparing."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 287.5,
    "end_time": 289.5,
    "text": "I think so too, but..."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 289.5,
    "end_time": 292.5,
    "text": "Or if she didn't, she's waiting for this week to do it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 292.5,
    "end_time": 293.5,
    "text": "I think so too."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 293.5,
    "end_time": 294.5,
    "text": "It's not like her."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 294.5,
    "end_time": 295.5,
    "text": "Yeah, it's not like her."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_002.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 295.5,
    "end_time": 297.5,
    "text": "Especially she's leaving mom alone."
